{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01YBhKoqaFcbdCrpUJrXwB7Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015o2rWYfiVNtf9Qxf4kKcHz","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/modded-nanogpt/REPORT.md","old_string":"| 8 | 113 | 2670 | 3.8252 |\n| 6 | 96  | 3145 | **3.8158** |\n| 4 | 71  | ~4400 | (running) |\n\nThe trend `12 > 8 > 6` confirms the hypothesis, though gains shrink (−0.037, then −0.009),\nsuggesting we're approaching the depth sweet spot. `n_layer=4` is being tested to find the floor.\n\n## What's next / remaining levers\n- Finish the depth floor (l4) and pick the best depth.\n- One tuning run on the winner (warmdown fraction / minor width).\n- Clean final re-verification run of the chosen best config.","new_string":"| 8 | 113 | 2670 | 3.8252 |\n| 6 | 96  | 3145 | **3.8158** |\n| 4 | 76  | 3962 | 3.8393 |\n\nDepth is **U-shaped with the optimum at 6 layers**: `4 (3.8393) > 6 (3.8158) < 8 (3.8252) < 12\n(3.8621)`. At 4 layers the capacity floor is hit — even with ~4000 steps it loses to 6L. Notably\nthe smaller models lead *early* (more steps) but capacity matters in the warmdown/late phase, which\nis why the ordering flips by 300s.\n\n## 4. Schedule tuning\nTesting a longer warmdown (`warmdown_frac` 0.28 → 0.45) on the 6-layer winner.\n\n## Remaining\n- Schedule tuning result, then a clean final re-verification of the chosen best config."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":806,"cache_read_input_tokens":129695,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":806},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e29014b2-1650-4138-bd86-b977ffa47697","uuid":"c59cabaf-9abb-4ea1-96a8-0585246cba09","request_id":"req_011CbijM2